      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It can feel like a forced surrender when the weight of decisions has crushed your ability to choose your own path again.\nPerhaps letting that honest sword remain is a way to finally make a choice without forcing your own hand into the duty you once wore so proudly.\nYou are not just a ghost haunting your life; you are the one writing the final, quiet stanza if you choose to stop waiting for a man you know is gone.",
